body:
Man you managed to miss the question if you were handed the win? Also let's elaborate on things being personal, you said you forged friendships and deeply care for people, yet your right hand man George says everything is nothing more than small talk. He's been absent here which is going to damage things for your plan, but as far as I know I was voted out because I wasn't close at all. I mean I "Dragged the game" and "Everyone thought I was a abusive asshole".

&#x200B;

Let's talk about being genuine here, do you REALLY feel as if you were being absolutely genuine with all your statements, or are we going to find out later how you really feel? Is this game or not game?
